 353+ 687A AF               XOR A                                   ; not statue -> Z (visible)
 354+ 687B C9               RET
 355+ 687C              .cshMatch:
 356+ 687C                  ; A es statue id. C = slot/type idx. Comprobar bit en MonsterTrappedFlags.
