 365+ 744A              ; ==============================================================================
 366+ 744A              ; ComputeMagicCompassPath - BFS reverse con state (sid, comp_local)
 367+ 744A              ; ==============================================================================
 368+ 744A              ; Algoritmo:
 369+ 744A              ;   1. queue.push((target_sid, target_comp=0)). Mark visited.
 370+ 744A              ;      target_comp = 0 (heurística: el pickup vive en la comp principal).
 371+ 744A              ;   2. While queue not empty:
 372+ 744A              ;        (R, R_comp) = queue.pop()
 373+ 744A              ;        For each gap in RoomCompGaps[R]:
 374+ 744A              ;          If gap.comp != R_comp: skip.
 375+ 744A              ;          V = neighbor of R via gap.side.
 376+ 744A              ;          Find V's gap with side=opposite(gap.side) AND coord=gap.coord.
 377+ 744A              ;          V_comp = that gap's comp.
 378+ 744A              ;          If (V, V_comp) visited: skip.
 379+ 744A              ;          If V == current_sid AND V_comp == player_current_comp:
 380+ 744A              ;            dir_player = opposite(gap.side); STORE; RETURN.
 381+ 744A              ;          Mark visited; queue.push((V, V_comp)).
 382+ 744A              ;
 383+ 744A              ; player_current_comp se determina via LastEntrySide:
 384+ 744A              ;   - LastEntrySide = side por el que el player entró a current_sid.
 385+ 744A              ;   - player_comp = comp del gap de current_sid en LastEntrySide.
 386+ 744A              ;   - Si LastEntrySide = $FF (boot/respawn), comp = 0 (fallback).
 387+ 744A              ;
 388+ 744A              ; OUT: MagicCompassPathDir = 0=N, 1=E, 2=S, 3=W; o $FF si sin path.
 389+ 744A              ; ==============================================================================
 390+ 744A              ; ComputeMagicCompassPath — wrapper que pagina bank 7 alrededor del BFS.
 391+ 744A              ; Las tablas RoomCompGaps_XX viven en bank 7 (movidas para liberar slot 1
 392+ 744A              ; del overflow). RoomCompGapsTable (pointer table) sigue en slot 1, pero
 393+ 744A              ; sus valores son addresses en $C000+ que solo se dereferencian con bank 7
 394+ 744A              ; paginado. El BFS body (renombrado a _Inner) solo llama a helpers .cmcp*
 395+ 744A              ; (todos en slot 1) — ningun CALL externo a bank 0.
 396+ 744A              ;
 397+ 744A              ; DIAGNOSTICO: revertido el SP alterno (commit e1e9c5f) para confirmar si era
 398+ 744A              ; la causa de "transiciones eternas al coger la brujula". Vuelta al patron DI
 399+ 744A              ; envolvente original.
 400+ 744A              ;
 401+ 744A              ; Mantiene DI durante todo el chunk BFS (~4000 T = 1/15 frame). Riesgo de
 402+ 744A              ; perder ~3 IRQ por segundo de compass activo, aceptable.
 403+ 744A              ; ==============================================================================
 404+ 744A              ComputeMagicCompassPath:
 405+ 744A F3               DI
 406+ 744B                  ; --- Page bank 7 in slot 3 ---
 407+ 744B 3A 85 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 408+ 744E E6 F8            AND $F8
 409+ 7450 F6 07            OR 7
 410+ 7452 32 85 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 411+ 7455 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 412+ 7458 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 413+ 745A
 414+ 745A CD 71 74         CALL _ComputeMagicCompassPath_Inner
 415+ 745D
 416+ 745D                  ; --- Page bank 0 back ---
 417+ 745D 3A 85 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 418+ 7460 E6 F8            AND $F8
 419+ 7462 32 85 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 420+ 7465 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 421+ 7468 ED 79            OUT (C), A
