  84+ 8DE4              MaiFlowBfs:
  85+ 8DE4                  ; Limpiar FlowField a $FF
  86+ 8DE4 21 D1 C9         LD HL, FlowField
  87+ 8DE7 54               LD D, H
  88+ 8DE8 5D               LD E, L
  89+ 8DE9 13               INC DE
  90+ 8DEA 01 BF 02         LD BC, 703
  91+ 8DED 36 FF            LD (HL), $FF
  92+ 8DEF ED B0            LDIR
