 258+ 99D3 3A 85 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 259+ 99D6 E6 F8            AND $F8
 260+ 99D8 32 85 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 261+ 99DB 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 262+ 99DE ED 79            OUT (C), A
 263+ 99E0 FB               EI
 264+ 99E1 C9               RET
