 327+ 9B19 3A 85 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 328+ 9B1C E6 F8            AND $F8
 329+ 9B1E 32 85 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 330+ 9B21 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 331+ 9B24 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 332+ 9B26 C9               RET
