 446+ 9BBA 13               INC DE
 447+ 9BBB 10 FA            DJNZ .restCol
 448+ 9BBD E1               POP HL
 449+ 9BBE D5               PUSH DE
 450+ 9BBF 11 20 00         LD DE, 32
 451+ 9BC2 19               ADD HL, DE
 452+ 9BC3 D1               POP DE
 453+ 9BC4 0D               DEC C
 454+ 9BC5 20 EB            JR NZ, .restRow
 455+ 9BC7 C9               RET
