2179+ AABF              .cwDoCheck:
2180+ AABF                  ; AABB con margen de 8px (1 celda) por cada lado:
2181+ AABF                  ; playerX < wellX+24 AND wellX-8 < playerX+16
2182+ AABF                  ; playerY < wellY+24 AND wellY-8 < playerY+21
2183+ AABF                  ; --- Check X ---
2184+ AABF 3A 5B 8D         LD A, (WellPosX)
