5600+ BD85 DD 19            ADD IX, DE
5601+ BD87 C1               POP BC
5602+ BD88 0C               INC C
5603+ BD89 05               DEC B
5604+ BD8A C2 21 BD         JP NZ, .smLoop
5605+ BD8D 3E 14            LD A, MONSTER_ENTRY_BASE
5606+ BD8F 32 DC BE         LD (TryRespawnMonsters.rmTimer), A
5607+ BD92                  ; Arrancar secuencer "po-po-popo-po" (canal B AY, sin tabla en slot 1).
5608+ BD92                  ; Se detiene al sunrise via StopMonstersMusic (day_cycle fase 5).
5609+ BD92 C3 27 F8         JP StartMonstersMusic           ; tail-call: sustituye RET
5610+ BD95
5611+ BD95              ; --- Barajar tablas tipo/color ---
