5649+ BDDF 57               LD D, A
5650+ BDE0 3A FB BD         LD A, (MonsterTypeTable + 2)
5651+ BDE3 32 FA BD         LD (MonsterTypeTable + 1), A
5652+ BDE6 7A               LD A, D
5653+ BDE7 32 FB BD         LD (MonsterTypeTable + 2), A
5654+ BDEA 3A FD BD         LD A, (MonsterColorTable + 1)
5655+ BDED 57               LD D, A
