5662+ BDF9              MonsterTypeTable:
5663+ BDF9 4C               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_0
5664+ BDFA 54               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_1
5665+ BDFB 5C               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_2
