7411+ C853 23               INC HL
7412+ C854 22 6D 5F         LD (DBfsQTail), HL
7413+ C857                  ; --- Score: max depth tie-break min manhattan ---
7414+ C857                  ; manhattan = |tryCx - playerCx| + |tryCy - playerCy|
7415+ C857 3A 78 5F         LD A, (DBfsTryCx)
7416+ C85A 57               LD D, A
