8082+ CC43                  ; --- Draw nuevo sprite ---
8083+ CC43 E5               PUSH HL
8084+ CC44 DD E1            POP IX
8085+ CC46 5F               LD E, A
8086+ CC47 16 38            LD D, GAMEOVER_ANIM_Y
8087+ CC49 C3 EA 99         JP DrawSprite                   ; tail-call
