2229+ D76B FE FE            CP $FE
2230+ D76D 28 41            JR Z, .rpbpSkipInactive
2231+ D76F 47               LD B, A                     ; mapX
2232+ D770 23               INC HL
2233+ D771 3A 0B 83         LD A, (CurrentScreenX)
2234+ D774 B8               CP B
