 181+ EA72              ; SetClockToPhaseHour
 182+ EA72              ; ==============================================================================
 183+ EA72              SetClockToPhaseHour:
 184+ EA72 21 91 E8         LD HL, PhaseStartHour
 185+ EA75 4F               LD C, A
 186+ EA76 06 00            LD B, 0
 187+ EA78 09               ADD HL, BC
 188+ EA79 7E               LD A, (HL)
 189+ EA7A 32 8E E8         LD (GameHours), A
 190+ EA7D AF               XOR A
 191+ EA7E 32 8D E8         LD (GameMinutes), A
 192+ EA81 32 8C E8         LD (GameSubMinute), A
 193+ EA84 C9               RET
