 228+ EAAC 38 05            JR C, .minOk
 229+ EAAE D6 05            SUB 5
 230+ EAB0 04               INC B
 231+ EAB1 18 F7            JR .divMin
 232+ EAB3              .minOk:
 233+ EAB3 78               LD A, B
 234+ EAB4 21 A6 E8         LD HL, MinHandPtrs
 235+ EAB7 CD A4 EC         CALL DrawHandLine
