 581+ ECD1 79               LD A, C
 582+ ECD2 2F               CPL
 583+ ECD3 A0               AND B
 584+ ECD4 C8               RET Z
 585+ ECD5
 586+ ECD5 CB 47            BIT 0, A
 587+ ECD7 28 06            JR Z, .try2
