 195+ F71E              ; --- SFX_CountdownTick: bip ~700ms para "3" y "2" del countdown ---
 196+ F71E              ; Pitch 102 = ~1047 Hz. Calibrado para octava precisa con pitch 50 (ratio 1.992).
 197+ F71E              ; (PlaySFX tiene ~78T de overhead por ciclo ademas de 32*pitch -> ratio puro
 198+ F71E              ; 100/50 quedaria desafinado ~30 cents. Compensado a 102 da ~7 cents.)
 199+ F71E              SFX_CountdownTick:
 200+ F71E FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~239ms
 201+ F722 FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~478ms
 202+ F726 E6 66 00 00      DEFB 230, 102, 0, 0         ; ~219ms (total ~718ms)
 203+ F72A 00               DEFB 0
 204+ F72B
 205+ F72B              ; --- SFX_CountdownGo: octava arriba del Tick, ~1s ---
 206+ F72B              ; Pitch 50 = ~2086 Hz. Ratio period(102)/period(50) = 3342/1678 = 1.992.
 207+ F72B              SFX_CountdownGo:
 208+ F72B FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0          ; ~120ms cada step
 209+ F72F FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 210+ F733 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 211+ F737 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 212+ F73B FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 213+ F73F FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 214+ F743 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 215+ F747 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 216+ F74B 5A 32 00 00      DEFB 90, 50, 0, 0           ; total ~1003ms
 217+ F74F 00               DEFB 0
 218+ F750
 219+ F750              ; --- SFX_BellChime: campanada grave de medianoche (~200ms) ---
 220+ F750              ; Tono grave resonante con decay lento, como campana de iglesia
 221+ F750              ; --- SFX_BellChime: una campanada grave (~corta, para repetir) ---
 222+ F750              SFX_BellChime:
 223+ F750 FA DC 00 00      DEFB 250, 220, 0, 0        ; golpe grave
 224+ F754 50 F0 01 00      DEFB 80, 240, 1, 0         ; decay
