 114+ F866              ; SFX "no no" — dos tonos alternos en canal B, tipo "uh-oh" cartoonish.
 115+ F866              ; Period AY = 1.7734 MHz / (16 * freq). Tercera mayor descendente Mi→Do.
 116+ F866              ; AY_PlayBeep recibe HL = period, B = duracion frames.
