 378+ F995              ; ---- Phase 17: WAIT_NASTIES ----
 379+ F995              ; Espera a que terminen los puffs de nasties + death antes de entrar a LOCK.
 380+ F995              ; ProcessEnemies + ProcessDeath se mantienen corriendo desde MainLoop
 381+ F995              ; ramifica especial. Re-llama a KillAllActiveNasties cada frame para cazar
 382+ F995              ; nasties que estaban en STATE_SPAWNING al disparar trigger.
 383+ F995              ;
 384+ F995              ; Transicion: cuando TownGateAllNastiesDeadCheck devuelve Z (todos los
 385+ F995              ; slots NASTY = TYPE_NONE) → setup LOCK con timer + RET. Si tarda demasiado
 386+ F995              ; (timeout BCS_T_PUFF_WAIT), tambien transiciona (safety net).
 387+ F995              .bcPhWaitNasties:
 388+ F995 CD EA B9         CALL KillAllActiveNasties           ; cazar spawnings recien terminados
 389+ F998 CD E7 63         CALL TownGateAllNastiesDeadCheck    ; reusa label (slot 1 always-vis)
 390+ F99B 28 04            JR Z, .bcWaitNastiesDone
 391+ F99D CD 09 FC         CALL BankCutsceneDecTimer           ; safety timeout
 392+ F9A0 C0               RET NZ
 393+ F9A1              .bcWaitNastiesDone:
 394+ F9A1 CD E0 F8         CALL BankCutsceneSnapToDoor         ; player se acerca a la puerta para LOCK + KNOCKS_1
 395+ F9A4 3E 1E            LD A, BCS_T_LOCK
 396+ F9A6 32 CD 82         LD (BankCutsceneTimer), A
 397+ F9A9 3E 01            LD A, BCP_LOCK
 398+ F9AB 32 CC 82         LD (BankCutscenePhase), A
 399+ F9AE C9               RET
